		{
			dependencies: ["58D02333F8040B09"]
			description: [
				"你可能已经注意到，整个世界焕然一新，变得更加美丽。这要归功于模组 &6\"Epic terrain compatible\"（也有单独的 \"Epic terrain\"，但它会与其他地形生成模组冲突）&r 和 &6\"William Whyther's expanded ecosphere\"（简称 WWEE）。&r 简单来说，Epic terrain 负责生成地形，如平原、河流、海洋等，而 WWEE 则负责添加植被和生物群系。"
				""
				"&2Note that Epic terrain is not perfect, so you might see some strange stuff, like oceans the size of lakes, custom biomes not generating blocks if an ocean is present, etc.&r Also, disabling these mods for the vanilla terrain or even adding other terrain gen mods like \"Tectonic\" is possible, just make sure you disable Epic terrain first! "
			]
